1	line	Guildmaster	Greetings!
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	What is this place?
2	line	Player	What is this place?
2	line	Guildmaster	This is the Champions' Guild. Only adventurers who have proved themselves worthy by gaining influence from quests are allowed in here.
2	action	end
1	option	Can I have a quest?
2	line	Player	Can I have a quest?
2	line	Guildmaster	Aha!
2	line	Guildmaster	Yes! A mighty and perilous quest fit only for the most powerful champions! And, at the end of it, you will earn the right to wear the legendary rune platebody!
2	cond	If the player does not have 45 combat or 33 Magic:
3	box	Before starting this quest, be aware that your combat level is lower than the recommended level of 45. One or more of your skill levels are also lower than recommended.
2	select	Start the Dragon Slayer I quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	So, what is this quest?
3	line	Guildmaster	You'll have to speak to Oziach, the maker of rune armour. He sets the quests that champions must complete in order to wear it.
3	line	Guildmaster	Oziach lives in a hut, by the cliffs to the west of Edgeville. He can be a little...odd...sometimes, though.
3	action	end
2	option	No.
3	line	Player	Actually, I'll give it a miss.
3	action	end
