0	section	Talking to Oziach
1	line	Oziach	Aye, 'tis a fair day my friend.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Can you sell me a rune platebody?
2	line	Player	Can you sell me a rune platebody?
2	line	Oziach	So, how does thee know I 'ave some?
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	The Guildmaster of the Champions' Guild told me.
3	line	Player	The Guildmaster of the Champions' Guild told me.
3	line	Oziach	Yes, I suppose he would, wouldn't he? He's always sending you fancy-pants 'heroes' up to bother me. Telling me I'll give them a quest or sommat like that.
3	line	Oziach	Well, I'm not going to let just anyone wear my rune platemail. It's only for heroes. So, leave me alone.
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	I thought you were going to give me a quest.
