4	line	Oziach	*Sigh*
4	line	Oziach	All right, I'll give ye a quest. I'll let ye wear my rune platemail if ye...
4	line	Oziach	Slay the dragon of Crandor!
4	select	Select an Option
4	option	A dragon, that sounds like fun.
5	line	Player	A dragon, that sounds like fun!
5	line	Oziach	Hah, yes, you are a typical reckless adventurer, aren't you? Now go kill the dragon and get out of my face.
5	line	Player	But how can I defeat the dragon?
5	line	Oziach	Go talk to the Guildmaster in the Champions' Guild. He'll help ye out if yer so keen on doing a quest. I'm not going to be handholding any adventurers.
5	action	end
