1	cond	If the player has planks but does not have any steel nails:
2	box	You need 30 steel nails to attach the plank with.
1	cond	If the player has planks and nails but does not have a hammer:
2	box	You need a hammer to force the nails in with.
1	cond	If the player has everything:
2	box	You nail a plank over the hole, but you still need more planks to close the hole completely.
2	box	You nail a plank over the hole, but you still need one more plank to close the hole completely.
2	box	You nail a final plank over the hole. You have successfully patched the hole in the ship.
